  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "In this walkthrough, we will open FEAT\ninside Neurodesk and build a map of its",
      "startSeconds": 0,
      "endSeconds": 6.956526168224299,
      "startFrame": 0,
      "endFrame": 209
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "interface before changing any analysis\nsettings.",
      "startSeconds": 6.956526168224299,
      "endSeconds": 9.739136635514019,
      "startFrame": 208,
      "endFrame": 293
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "FEAT is both a model-configuration\ninterface and a pipeline runner.",
      "startSeconds": 9.739136635514019,
      "endSeconds": 14.376820747663551,
      "startFrame": 292,
      "endFrame": 432
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The choices made here determine the data,\npreprocessing, registration, statistical",
      "startSeconds": 14.376820747663551,
      "endSeconds": 19.014504859813083,
      "startFrame": 431,
      "endFrame": 571
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "model, and reporting steps that FSL will\nexecute.",
      "startSeconds": 19.014504859813083,
      "endSeconds": 22.72465214953271,
      "startFrame": 570,
      "endFrame": 682
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Begin on the Neurodesktop workspace.",
      "startSeconds": 22.72465214953271,
      "endSeconds": 25.043494205607473,
      "startFrame": 681,
      "endFrame": 752
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Open the Applications menu, choose\nNeurodesk, then Functional Imaging, FSL,",
      "startSeconds": 25.043494205607473,
      "endSeconds": 29.681178317757006,
      "startFrame": 751,
      "endFrame": 891
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "and the approved FSL version.",
      "startSeconds": 29.681178317757006,
      "endSeconds": 32.000020373831774,
      "startFrame": 890,
      "endFrame": 961
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "This versioned launcher prepares the\nenvironment so the FSL commands and",
      "startSeconds": 32.000020373831774,
      "endSeconds": 37.10147289719626,
      "startFrame": 960,
      "endFrame": 1114
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "graphical tools are available in the\nterminal it opens.",
      "startSeconds": 37.10147289719626,
      "endSeconds": 41.27538859813084,
      "startFrame": 1113,
      "endFrame": 1239
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "That is more reproducible than assuming\nthat a terminal outside this environment",
      "startSeconds": 41.27538859813084,
      "endSeconds": 46.840609532710275,
      "startFrame": 1238,
      "endFrame": 1406
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "is using the intended FSL installation.",
      "startSeconds": 46.840609532710275,
      "endSeconds": 49.623219999999996,
      "startFrame": 1405,
      "endFrame": 1489
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "At the prompt, enter `Feat`, with a\ncapital F, followed by an ampersand.",
      "startSeconds": 50.473220000000005,
      "endSeconds": 55.93717938947369,
      "startFrame": 1514,
      "endFrame": 1679
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "The capitalised command starts the FEAT\ngraphical interface; the lower-case `feat`",
      "startSeconds": 55.93717938947369,
      "endSeconds": 60.56052964210527,
      "startFrame": 1678,
      "endFrame": 1817
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "command expects a saved design file.",
      "startSeconds": 60.560529642105266,
      "endSeconds": 63.08235705263158,
      "startFrame": 1816,
      "endFrame": 1893
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "The ampersand returns control of the\nterminal while the interface remains open.",
      "startSeconds": 63.082357052631586,
      "endSeconds": 68.12601187368422,
      "startFrame": 1892,
      "endFrame": 2044
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "If the window takes a moment to appear,\nwait.",
      "startSeconds": 68.12601187368422,
      "endSeconds": 71.9087529894737,
      "startFrame": 2043,
      "endFrame": 2158
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Starting another copy simply because the\nlaunch is quiet can leave several",
      "startSeconds": 71.9087529894737,
      "endSeconds": 76.95240781052632,
      "startFrame": 2157,
      "endFrame": 2309
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "indistinguishable FEAT windows open.",
      "startSeconds": 76.95240781052632,
      "endSeconds": 78.63362608421053,
      "startFrame": 2308,
      "endFrame": 2360
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "FEAT may remember settings from an earlier\nsession, so treat every value as something",
      "startSeconds": 78.63362608421053,
      "endSeconds": 84.51789004210526,
      "startFrame": 2359,
      "endFrame": 2536
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "to verify.",
      "startSeconds": 84.51789004210526,
      "endSeconds": 85.35849917894737,
      "startFrame": 2535,
      "endFrame": 2561
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "A familiar-looking interface is not\nevidence that the current design is safe.",
      "startSeconds": 85.35849917894737,
      "endSeconds": 90.402154,
      "startFrame": 2560,
      "endFrame": 2713
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "At the top of FEAT, select First-level\nanalysis.",
      "startSeconds": 91.252154,
      "endSeconds": 95.03815925,
      "startFrame": 2737,
      "endFrame": 2852
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "First level means one run from one\nparticipant.",
      "startSeconds": 95.03815925,
      "endSeconds": 98.82416450000001,
      "startFrame": 2851,
      "endFrame": 2965
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "It is not a within-subject combination\nacross runs, and it is not a group",
      "startSeconds": 98.82416450000001,
      "endSeconds": 105.44967368750001,
      "startFrame": 2964,
      "endFrame": 3164
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "analysis.",
      "startSeconds": 105.44967368750001,
      "endSeconds": 105.92292434375001,
      "startFrame": 3163,
      "endFrame": 3178
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Keeping that unit explicit prevents\nparticipant-specific results from being",
      "startSeconds": 105.92292434375,
      "endSeconds": 110.18218025,
      "startFrame": 3177,
      "endFrame": 3306
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "described as population conclusions.",
      "startSeconds": 110.18218025,
      "endSeconds": 112.075182875,
      "startFrame": 3305,
      "endFrame": 3363
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Next, select Full analysis for this\norientation.",
      "startSeconds": 112.07518287500001,
      "endSeconds": 115.38793746875001,
      "startFrame": 3362,
      "endFrame": 3462
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Full analysis exposes the steps used to\nprepare and model a run.",
      "startSeconds": 115.38793746875001,
      "endSeconds": 121.06694534375,
      "startFrame": 3461,
      "endFrame": 3633
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "This is a scope choice, not a universal\nrecommendation.",
      "startSeconds": 121.06694534375,
      "endSeconds": 125.32620125000001,
      "startFrame": 3632,
      "endFrame": 3760
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "If the input has already been\npreprocessed, the workflow must be",
      "startSeconds": 125.32620125,
      "endSeconds": 130.53195846875,
      "startFrame": 3759,
      "endFrame": 3916
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "adjusted so that motion correction,\nsmoothing, filtering, or registration are",
      "startSeconds": 130.53195846875002,
      "endSeconds": 135.26446503125,
      "startFrame": 3915,
      "endFrame": 4058
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "not repeated unintentionally.",
      "startSeconds": 135.26446503125,
      "endSeconds": 136.68421700000002,
      "startFrame": 4057,
      "endFrame": 4101
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "The Data tab establishes the identity of\nthe model.",
      "startSeconds": 137.534217,
      "endSeconds": 141.92557123255816,
      "startFrame": 4126,
      "endFrame": 4258
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "It contains the four-dimensional\nfunctional input, repetition time, number",
      "startSeconds": 141.92557123255816,
      "endSeconds": 146.3169254651163,
      "startFrame": 4257,
      "endFrame": 4390
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "of volumes, and output directory.",
      "startSeconds": 146.3169254651163,
      "endSeconds": 148.75656670542637,
      "startFrame": 4389,
      "endFrame": 4463
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "These values connect image sampling to\nexperimental timing.",
      "startSeconds": 148.75656670542637,
      "endSeconds": 152.6599926899225,
      "startFrame": 4462,
      "endFrame": 4580
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Later, we will verify them against the\nimage header and BIDS metadata before",
      "startSeconds": 152.6599926899225,
      "endSeconds": 159.00305991472868,
      "startFrame": 4579,
      "endFrame": 4771
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "entering them.",
      "startSeconds": 159.00305991472868,
      "endSeconds": 159.97891641085272,
      "startFrame": 4770,
      "endFrame": 4800
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "The Pre-stats tab controls preprocessing\noperations such as motion correction,",
      "startSeconds": 159.97891641085272,
      "endSeconds": 164.85819889147288,
      "startFrame": 4799,
      "endFrame": 4946
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "brain extraction, spatial smoothing, and\ntemporal filtering.",
      "startSeconds": 164.85819889147288,
      "endSeconds": 168.273696627907,
      "startFrame": 4945,
      "endFrame": 5049
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "These are scientific decisions.",
      "startSeconds": 168.273696627907,
      "endSeconds": 170.22540962015503,
      "startFrame": 5048,
      "endFrame": 5107
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Applying a step twice is not neutral, and\nleaving a required step off is not",
      "startSeconds": 170.22540962015506,
      "endSeconds": 177.5443333410853,
      "startFrame": 5106,
      "endFrame": 5327
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "repaired by a plausible activation map.",
      "startSeconds": 177.5443333410853,
      "endSeconds": 180.47190282945738,
      "startFrame": 5326,
      "endFrame": 5415
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "The Registration tab controls mappings\nbetween functional, anatomical, and",
      "startSeconds": 180.47190282945738,
      "endSeconds": 184.86325706201552,
      "startFrame": 5414,
      "endFrame": 5546
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "standard spaces.",
      "startSeconds": 184.86325706201552,
      "endSeconds": 185.83911355813956,
      "startFrame": 5545,
      "endFrame": 5576
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "A completed transform only shows that an\noptimisation finished.",
      "startSeconds": 185.83911355813953,
      "endSeconds": 190.23046779069767,
      "startFrame": 5575,
      "endFrame": 5707
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Registration quality must still be checked\nvisually across the brain, including",
      "startSeconds": 190.23046779069767,
      "endSeconds": 195.59767851937985,
      "startFrame": 5706,
      "endFrame": 5868
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "cortical boundaries, ventricles,\ncerebellum, and areas of incomplete",
      "startSeconds": 195.59767851937983,
      "endSeconds": 199.50110450387595,
      "startFrame": 5867,
      "endFrame": 5986
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "functional coverage.",
      "startSeconds": 199.50110450387598,
      "endSeconds": 200.47696100000002,
      "startFrame": 5985,
      "endFrame": 6015
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "The Stats tab defines the general linear\nmodel.",
      "startSeconds": 200.476961,
      "endSeconds": 204.3803869844961,
      "startFrame": 6014,
      "endFrame": 6132
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Here, explanatory variables represent task\nconditions or nuisance structure.",
      "startSeconds": 204.3803869844961,
      "endSeconds": 208.77174121705426,
      "startFrame": 6131,
      "endFrame": 6264
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Task timing can be convolved with a\nhaemodynamic response, contrasts encode",
      "startSeconds": 208.77174121705426,
      "endSeconds": 214.13895194573644,
      "startFrame": 6263,
      "endFrame": 6425
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "planned hypotheses, and the design preview\nexposes the actual matrix FEAT will fit.",
      "startSeconds": 214.13895194573644,
      "endSeconds": 220.48201917054263,
      "startFrame": 6424,
      "endFrame": 6615
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Before running anything, the columns,\ntiming, correlations, and contrast weights",
      "startSeconds": 220.48201917054263,
      "endSeconds": 225.3613016511628,
      "startFrame": 6614,
      "endFrame": 6761
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "must tell the same experimental story as\nthe protocol.",
      "startSeconds": 225.3613016511628,
      "endSeconds": 229.75265588372093,
      "startFrame": 6760,
      "endFrame": 6893
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "The Post-stats tab controls thresholding\nand result reporting.",
      "startSeconds": 229.75265588372093,
      "endSeconds": 233.65608186821706,
      "startFrame": 6892,
      "endFrame": 7010
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "It is tempting to start with bright\nclusters, but inference is only",
      "startSeconds": 233.65608186821706,
      "endSeconds": 239.51122084496126,
      "startFrame": 7009,
      "endFrame": 7186
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "interpretable after the input,\npreprocessing, registration, and design",
      "startSeconds": 239.51122084496126,
      "endSeconds": 243.41464682945738,
      "startFrame": 7185,
      "endFrame": 7303
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "have passed their own quality-control\nchecks.",
      "startSeconds": 243.41464682945735,
      "endSeconds": 246.34221631782944,
      "startFrame": 7302,
      "endFrame": 7391
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "The Misc tab contains auxiliary settings\nand output options.",
      "startSeconds": 246.34221631782947,
      "endSeconds": 250.7335705503876,
      "startFrame": 7390,
      "endFrame": 7523
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Most projects use only a subset of them,\nbut they remain part of the saved design",
      "startSeconds": 250.7335705503876,
      "endSeconds": 258.54042251937983,
      "startFrame": 7522,
      "endFrame": 7757
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "and should be reviewed when reproducing or\nauditing an analysis.",
      "startSeconds": 258.54042251937983,
      "endSeconds": 263.41970499999996,
      "startFrame": 7756,
      "endFrame": 7903
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "The practical order is Data, Pre-stats,\nRegistration, Stats, Post-stats, and then",
      "startSeconds": 264.269705,
      "endSeconds": 269.3938840875,
      "startFrame": 7928,
      "endFrame": 8082
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Misc.",
      "startSeconds": 269.3938840875,
      "endSeconds": 269.85971855,
      "startFrame": 8081,
      "endFrame": 8096
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "That order moves from the measured time\nseries, through preparation and spatial",
      "startSeconds": 269.85971854999997,
      "endSeconds": 275.44973209999995,
      "startFrame": 8095,
      "endFrame": 8264
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "alignment, into the model and finally the\nreport.",
      "startSeconds": 275.4497321,
      "endSeconds": 279.1764078,
      "startFrame": 8263,
      "endFrame": 8376
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "For now, leave the values unchanged.",
      "startSeconds": 279.1764078,
      "endSeconds": 281.971414575,
      "startFrame": 8375,
      "endFrame": 8460
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "You have opened the intended FSL\nenvironment, launched FEAT, selected a",
      "startSeconds": 281.971414575,
      "endSeconds": 287.0955936625,
      "startFrame": 8459,
      "endFrame": 8613
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "first-level scope, and identified what\neach tab controls.",
      "startSeconds": 287.0955936625,
      "endSeconds": 290.8222693625,
      "startFrame": 8612,
      "endFrame": 8725
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "In the next walkthrough, we will configure\nthe Data tab using a real BOLD run and",
      "startSeconds": 290.8222693625,
      "endSeconds": 298.27562076249995,
      "startFrame": 8724,
      "endFrame": 8949
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "verify every value against the source\nfiles.",
      "startSeconds": 298.2756207625,
      "endSeconds": 301.53646200000003,
      "startFrame": 8948,
      "endFrame": 9047
    }
  ]
}
